 example, you might meet someone who has a bad reputation, but after getting to know them, you realize that they are actually a kind and gentle person.","wo":"Ci misaal, mën nga daje ak nit ku deram yàqu, waaye boo demee ba miinante ak moom, nga gis ni nit ku baax, liñ doon wax ci moom amul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi missal meun nga dadjé ak nitt kou deram yakhou wayé bo démé ba minanté ak mom, nga guiss ni nitt kou bakh lignou done wakh thi mom amoul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3306,"row":{"en":"The suspicious smell becomes overwhelming when somebody takes a shot at the lady outside her London hotel.","wo":"Xet guiy niuy laam laamé dafay jegui dayo bu nitt xoolé ndaw si nek ci bitti hotelu Londres bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhet guiy niouy laam laamé dafay diegui dayo bou nitt kholé ndaw si nek thi bitti hotelou Londres bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3307,"row":{"en":"Probably just convenient timing because yeah, it’s otherwise slim pickings.","wo":"Waxtu la wu mbir yi di yomb waaw, luko moy muy tànneef yu sew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWakhtou la wou mbir yi di yombe waw, louko moy mouy taneuf you sew.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3308,"row":{"en":"You can also print copies of their records.","wo":"Mën nga itam imprime seeni dokimaa.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nga itam imprimer séni dokima.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3309,"row":{"en":"Heat waves, droughts, floods, and storms can all damage crops and livestock, and make it difficult for farmers to get their crops to market.","wo":"Tàngoor wu metti wi, bekkoor yi, mbënd yi, ak taw yu metti ànd ak ngelaw mën na yàq mbay mi ak jur gi, ba noppi baykat yi dañu am jafe-jafe yóbbu seen mbay ca marse ba.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTangor wou metti wi, bekhor yi, mbeund yi ak taw you metti and ak nguelaw meun na yak mbay mi ak jur gui ba noppi baykat yi daniou ame diafé diafé yobou sen mbay thia marché ba.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3310,"row":{"en":"Victims are often lured into the country with promises of a job or a better life.","wo":"Ñi ciy faral di daanu mooy ñi xoy ni dañu leen di yóbbu ci réew mu bari xaalis ndax ñu tekki.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGni thiy faral di danou moy gni khoy ni daniou len di yobou si rew mou bari khalis ndakh gnou tekki.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3311,"row":{"en":"Just to clarify, though, assertive is not the same as aggressive or arrogant.","wo":"Waaye ngir leer rek, waax sa dêgg wuute na ak tàng xol wala xeeb nit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé nguir leer rek wakh sa deug wouté na ak tang khol wala héb nitt.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3312,"row":{"en":"Akosua Aunty: Hello, children. What can I do for you?","wo":"Akosua Aunty: Xale yi na ngeen def? Lu ngeen bëggoon?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAkosua Aunty: Khalé yi na ngéne def? Lou ngéne beugone ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3313,"row":{"en":"If the winner resides in one of the 48 states, they will have the option of a Kindle edition or paperback.","wo":"Sudee ki jël raw-gàddu gi ci benn ci 48 etaa yi la dëkk, mooy tànn ndax edition Kindle lay jël wala livre de poche.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou dé ki dieul raw gadou gui thi ben thi 48 etats yi la deuk, moy tane ndakh édition kindle lay dieul wala livre de poche.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3314,"row":{"en":"You can do this by asking for recommendations from friends or family, or by doing some online research.","wo":"Soo mënul xam gaaraas bu wóor, laajal say xarit wala say mbokk, wala nga seet ci net.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo meunoul kham gaaraas bou woor ladial saay kharit wala say mbok wala nga set si net bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3315,"row":{"en":"Other important exports include cobalt, zinc, and lead.","wo":"Leneen luñuy jaay itam ñooy cobalt, zinc ak bettax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLeneen lougnouy diay itam gnoy cobalt, zinc ak bettakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3316,"row":{"en":"Specialty hospitals focus on a particular type of care, such as cancer care, cardiac care, or orthopedic care.","wo":"Hopitaal yi yam ci menn xeetu paj, ñooy faj lu melni cancer, xol tawati tànk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHopital yi yam thi men xeetu path, gnoy fath lou melni cancer, khole tawati tank.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3317,"row":{"en":"People may have trouble being honest about what their issues around food really are.","wo":"Nit ñi mën nañu baña dëggu ngir xam fu seen jafe-jafe nekk ci wàllu dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit gni meun nagnou bagna deugu nguir kham fou seen diafé diafé nekk thi wallou doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3318,"row":{"en":"The customer is responsible for the cost of returning the item.","wo":"Kiliyaan bi mooy fay paas biy delloo limu jëndoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKiliyan bi moy fay passe bi day dello limou dieundone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3319,"row":{"en":"It has no eyes, but I can see two large, pointed ears.","wo":"Amul bët, waaye maa ngi gis ñaari nopp yu rëy yu am cat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmoul beut wayé mangui guiss gnari nopp you reuy you ame thiat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3320,"row":{"en":"We pay special attention to adjust our development approach according to your main aim.","wo":"Danuy fexe wut nu ñuy def ba sunu gis-gis ci yokkute méngoo ak li ngeen di yóotu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanouy fexé wout nou gnouy def ba sounou guiss-guiss ci yokouté méngoo ak li ngéne di yootou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3321,"row":{"en":"The Nyika Plateau is a highland region in northern 