standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGuestou bi dafa wané ni dieufandiko onde de son gnou geun ko khamé thi ultrasound, nguir saytou cancer ou ween meun na takh ndioumté wakh ni amna yi thi resultats yi waniéku.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3333,"row":{"en":"The conflict was hectic and I was frightened at first, but I became numb soon, and my mind was absent like it had been erased with an eraser, and everything seemed very abstract.","wo":"Xeex bi tàngoon na lool, waaye dama mujjee ragal, sama yaram diis, samam xel sori melni dañu ko efaase ci sama bopp, may gis nit ñi melni dama nekk ci gént.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhékh bi tangone na loool wayé dama moudié ragal sama yarame diiss sama khél sori melni daniouko effacé ci sama bopp may guiss nitt gni melni dama nekk ci guent.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3334,"row":{"en":"To make the most of your birthday, start by making a list of all the things you are grateful for.","wo":"Soo bëggee sa aniwerseer neex, tàmbalil lim mbir yi nga wara delloo njukkal yépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo beugué sa annivairsair nékh, tambalil lim mbir yi nga wara dello njukal yeup.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3335,"row":{"en":"That's what makes it so funny, said Tom People are going to be so confused.","wo":"Tom ni ko, loolu moo tax mu xoromu, dina jaaxal nit ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTom niko lolou mo takh mou khoromou dina diahal nitt gni\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3336,"row":{"en":"The horn section provided a distinct complement of both rhythm and melodic harmony.","wo":"Mboolo horn bi dafa def lu wuute ci wallu ritm ak melodi yép","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbollo horn bi dafa def lou wouté si wallou rythme ak mélodie yep\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3337,"row":{"en":"Tender cabbage, fluffy potato gnocchi, and smoky sausage swim in a creamy, cheesy beer soup base.","wo":"Chou