akon bi tuuru dafay dess ci kaw etaser bi te du roogalaat feneen ba tilimal frigo bi yep.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYolaakon bi tourou dafay dess thi kaw étagère bi té dou rogalate fénéne ba tilimal frigo bi yeup.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3343,"row":{"en":"You could start working on it now, and take breaks throughout the day.","wo":"Mën nga ko tàmbali leegi, ngay noppalu saa yoo sonnee ci bis bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nga ko tambali légui, ngay noppalou sa yoo soné thi biss bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3344,"row":{"en":"When it was time for me to go, she gave me a hug.","wo":"Bima demee bay ñibbi, ci lama laxasu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBima démé bay gnibi si la ma lakhassou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3345,"row":{"en":"I am grateful for the opportunity to have attended a high school that provided me with such a strong educational foundation.","wo":"Maa ngi sant Yàlla bimu ma yóbboo ci liise bu def ci man yar bu am doole buma jàppale ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMangui sant yalla bima yobo thi lycée bou def thi mane yar bou am dolé bouma diapalé thi aduna\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3346,"row":{"en":"Two men, one in his 30s and one in his 50s, are sitting at the bar, drinking.","wo":"Ñaari nit la, kenn ki tollu ci 30 at keneen ki tollu ci 50 at, ñoo toog ci baar bi di naan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnaari nitt la, kene ki tollou thi 30 ans keneen ki tollou thi 50 ans, gno togue thi bar bi di nane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3347,"row":{"en":"Strategic supplier relationships, providing extensive technical knowledge.","wo":"Amal relasioŋ strategik ak furnisër yi dina la may nga am xam-xami xarala yu xóot.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmal relation stratégique ak fournisseur yi dina la may nga ame kham khami kharala you khot.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3348,"row":{"en":"But she is trying her best, and her teammates are encouraging her.","wo":"Waaye mingi def lépp lumu mën, te ñi mu bokkal ekip ñu ngi koy jàppale.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé moungui deff leep loumou meun té gni mou bokal ekip gnou ngui koy diapalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3349,"row":{"en":"Spring is a time of new beginnings, and I am always excited to see what the new season will bring.","wo":"Pringtemps mooy jamono ndoorte lu bees, te saa yu nekk damay yàkkamtee gis li jamono ju bees ji di indaale.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPrintemps moy diamono ndorté lou bess té saa you nek damay yakamti guiss li diamono djou bess dji di indalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3350,"row":{"en":"Strengthening families through biblical principles and Kingdom values.","wo":"Yar njaboot gi ci njàngalem bible ak valeur yu dëkku buur.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYar njaboot gui thi njangalem bible ak valeur you deukou bour.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3351,"row":{"en":"Whereas haze is often thought of as a phenomenon of dry air, mist formation is a phenomenon of humid air.","wo":"Danuy wax ni brume ngelaw lu tàng moo ko waral, waayé may ngelaw lu am ndox moo koy waral.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanouy wakh ni brume ngelaw lou tang moko waral wayé may ngelaw lou ame ndokh moko waral.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3352,"row":{"en":"You can go to a dealership, an independent repair shop, or a chain repair shop.","wo":"Mën nga ko yóbbu ci konsesioneer, gaaraasu mekanisien, wala gaaraas bu mag buy defar lépp ci oto.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nga ko yobou thi consessionnaire, garassou mécanicien, wala garass bou mague bouy defar lep thi auto.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3353,"row":{"en":"The river was home to many creatures, including fish, frogs, turtles, and birds.","wo":"Mu amoon mbindéef yu bari yu dëkkoon ci dex googu, lu ci melni jën, mbott, mbonaat ak picc.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou amone mbindef you bari you deukone thi dex gogou, lou thi melni dieun, mbott, mbonate ak pith.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3354,"row":{"en":"And we must bind ourselves together in a common purpose: to build a better future for Nigeria.","wo":"Ba noppi danu wara bokk benn mébet: liggéey Nigeria mu jëm ca kanam ëlëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa noppi daniou wara bokk bene mébeut: ligueye Nigeria mou dieum thia kanam eleuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3355,"row":{"en":"I started with a sampling of cheeses from a local farm, and then moved on to a booth that was serving grilled oysters.","wo":"Ma tàmbalee ci mos fromage yi baykati dëkk bi defar, bima fa joge ma dem ci barab bi ñuy mayee yéet buñ lakk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa tambalé thi mos fromage yi baykat yi deuk bi defar bima fa diogué ma dem thi barab bi gnuy mayé yéet bougn lakk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3356,"row":{"en":"One of the most interesting exhibits was the collection of old toys.","wo":"Benn ci fësal art bu ci gëna mag mooy tànneefu fowukaay yu yàgg ya.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi fessal art bou thi geuna mag moy taneffou fowoukay you yague ya.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3357,"row":{"en":"Finally, he made his selections and headed to the checkout counter.","wo":"Mu mujjee def tànneefam daal di jubal fi ñuy fayee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou moudié def tanéfam daldi djoubal fi gnouy fayé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3358,"row":{"en":"I think integrity is so important because it helps us build trust with others.","wo":"Dama jàpp ni ànd ak njub, dina tax nit ñi dila wóolu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama diap ni ande ak ndioub dina takh nitt gni dila woulou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3359,"row":{"en":"Sadly, their ultimate sacrifice merely delayed the invasion.","wo":"Lu daw yaram, seen joxe bàkkan bu mujje tax ñu yeex leen song.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou daw yarame seen diokhé bakane bou moudié takh niou yeukh léne songe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3360,"row":{"en":"I was able to work on the project for longer periods of time without getting tired, and the stitches were easier to make.","wo":"Maa ngi ci doon liggéey lu yàgg te mësu ma ci tàyyi, ba noppi yenn tombi ñaw yi ñoo gënoon yomba defar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMagui thii done ligueye lou yague té meusouma thii tayyi, ba noppi yenn tombi gnaw yii nio geuneu wone yomba defar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3361,"row":{"en":"She had let others tell her that she was wrong, that she was dirty, that she was not worthy of love.","wo":"Dafa seetaan nit ñi naan ko waxoo dëgg, danga tilim, yaw yelloo woo ñu lay bëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa sétane nitt gni nane ko wakhoo deugg, danga tilime, yaw yelloo woo gnou lay beugg.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3362,"row":{"en":"During World War II, the Allies and Axis powers used a variety of aircraft to achieve air superiority.","wo":"Ci ñaareelu guerre mondiale, larme Aliye yi ak yu Axe yi jël nañu xeetu roppalaan bu nekk ngir gañe xeexu jawwu ji.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi gniarelou guerre mondiale, larme Aliye yi ak you Axe yi dieul naniou khettou roppalaan bou nekk nguir gagné khekhou djaw dji.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3363,"row":{"en":"There are many things we can do to conserve water.","wo":"Barina mbir yuñ mëna def ngir baña yàq ndox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina mbir you gnou meuna def nguir bagna yak ndokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3364,"row":{"en":"If he wants to keep good people, he needs to change his ways.","wo":"Su bañee nit ñu baax ñ