row_idx":3370,"row":{"en":"Be sure to ask about any additional fees, such as fuel charges, insurance, or tolls.","wo":"Laajteel bu baax ndax yaay jënd essence, assurance wala fay peage.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLadjtél bou bakh ndakh yay dieund essence, assurance wala fay péage.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3371,"row":{"en":"To solve your query, I am explaining the difference between the kitchen chimney and exhaust fan.","wo":"Ngir tontu sa lajte, mangi leeral wuute gi nekk digante gennukaayu saxaaru waañ ak xandal buy gennee ngalaw lu bonn li.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNgir tontou sa ladjé mangui léral wouté gui nek diganté guénékayou saharou wagn ak khandal bouy guéné ngalaw lou bone li.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3372,"row":{"en":"We talked for a long time.","wo":"Nu séq waxtaan lu yàgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou sék wakhtane lou yague.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3373,"row":{"en":"Here is a delicious pork dish from the county of Lancashire.","wo":"Li togg bu neex la, bu am yàppu mbaam, mingi cosaanoo réewum Lancashire.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi togue bou nekh la bou ame yapou mbame moungui cosano rewoum lancashire\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3374,"row":{"en":"If you're new to embroidery, I recommend starting with a larger pattern with looser stitches.","wo":"Sudee dangay sooga dugg ci brodëri, maa ngi lay digal nga tàmbalee ci motif yu gëna rëy ak tombi ñaw yu gëna yolom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé dangay soga dougg si broderie, mangui lay digual nga tambalé thi motif you geuna reuy ak tombi niaw you geuna yoloome.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3375,"row":{"en":"Unlike the earlier films, relatively trim 80-minute affairs, Midnight runs nearly thirty minutes longer.","wo":"Film yu njëkk ya dañu daan dem ba 80 simili ci guddaay waaye Midnight mingi wara yam ci simili.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFilm you nieuk ya daniou dane dem ba 80 simili thi goudday wayé midnight mingui wara yam si simili.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3376,"row":{"en":"The monitor component includes a menu-driven operator interface.","wo":"Àndaaleb monitër bi dafa am interfaasu operatër bu mënu bi di dawal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAndaleub monitereur bi dafa ame interfaasou operateur bou meune bi di dawal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3377,"row":{"en":"We were on a family trip out to California to visit my aunt, uncle, and cousin.","wo":"Man ak sama famiy danu doon tukki ci Californie ngir seeti sama tànta, ndijaay ak sama cousin.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMane ak sama famille daniou done touki thie californie nguir séti sama tante ndiaay ak sama cousin.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3378,"row":{"en":"Demonstrate possession of sufficient financial resources to cover travel expenses.","wo":"Waneel ni am nga xaalis bu doy ngir mëna fay tukki bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWanél ni am nga khaliss bou doy nguir meuna fay touki bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3379,"row":{"en":"A healthy diet and regular exercise can help you maintain a healthy weight, reduce your risk of chronic diseases, and improve your mood and energy levels.","wo":"Soo amee regime bu sell, di faral di tàggat sa yaram mën nga am yaram wu rafet, doo gaawa am feebar yu kronik, dangay neex deret te dangay gëna sawar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo amé régime bou sell di faral di taggat sa yaram meun nga ame yaram wou rafet do gawa ame fébar you kronik dangay nékh deret té dangay geuna sawar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3380,"row":{"en":"Scientists can also put a radio collar on an elephant and trace its movements to warn farmers.","wo":"Saytukatt yi mën nañu takkal niayy ak ceeni baat té di toppu bepp yengu yengoom ngir meuna xibaar baykatt yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSaytoukat yi meun nagnou takal niaye ak séni bat té di topou beup yeungou yeungoum nguir meuna khibaar baykat yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3381,"row":{"en":"He quickly implemented a series of radical reforms, including nationalizing banks and industry, redistributing land, and promoting women's rights.","wo":"Ci saasi mu indi coppite yu am solo, lu ci melni, fexe ba réewam moom bànk yi ak usine yi, séddalewaat suuf yi, ak gëna dooleel yelleefi ak sañ-sañi jigéen ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi sasi mou indi coppité you am solo, lou ci melni, fékhé ba réwam mom bank yi ak usine yi, sedaléwat souf yi ak geuna dolél yellefé ak sagn sagnou djiguéne gni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3382,"row":{"en":"Jones said that the institute was in major cities like Los Angeles, USA; New York, USA; and New Delhi, India.","wo":"John dafa wax nit daara jaa ngi nekkoon ci dëkk yu mag yu melni Los Angeles, Etats Unis; New York, Etats Unis, ak New Delhi, Inde.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJohn dafa wakh nitt daara dja ngui nekone thi deuk you mag you melni Los Angeles, Etats Unis; New York, Etats Unis, ak New Delhi, Inde.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3383,"row":{"en":"I went over to investigate and saw that she was chewing on a piece of fiber from one of our clothes.","wo":"Bima xoolee bu baax ma gis ni limu sàqami benn fibre la bu bawoo ci benn ci sunu yéere.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBima khoole bou bakh ma guiss ni limou sakami bene fibre la bou bawoo thi bene si sounou yéré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3384,"row":{"en":"It is a story about self-discovery and empowerment, and it is a reminder that we are all capable of achieving great things if we are willing to step outside of our comfort zones and face the challenges that life throws our way.","wo":"Léeb bi dafay jàngale xam sa bopp ak fa jom, te dafay fàttali nit ñi ni, ku nekk ci nun mën na yegg famu bëgga yégg su gëmee boppan, nangu joge ci lu yomb li muy dundu fas yéene dem jàmmarloo ak jafe-jafey àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLééb bi dafay diangalé kham sa bopp ak fa diom té dafay fattali nitt gni ni kou nek si gnoune meun na yegg famou beuga yégg sou geumeu boppam nangou diogué si lou yombe li mouy doundou fas yéné dem diamarlo ak diafé-diaféy addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3385,"row":{"en":"Further, consent and mutual pleasure are morally necessary.","wo":"Yokku ci né, deggo ak baneex ci niaar niepp lu warr la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYokou thi né degou ak baneikh thi niar nieup lou war la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3386,"row":{"en":"Litter is unsightly and can be a hazard to wildlife.","wo":"Mbalit du lu rafet a gis, te mën na jural baayima yi loraange.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbalite dou lou raféte a guiss té meun na dioural bayima yi loragne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3387,"row":{"en":"The earliest evidence of human settlement in Ethiopia dates back to the Paleolithic period, with the discovery of stone tools and other artifacts.","wo":"Firnde yi ñu am ci nit ñi njëkka sanc Ethiopie mingi méngoo ak jamonoy Paleolitik, ginaaw jumtukaayi xeer yiñ fa gis ak yeneen mbiri art.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFirndé yi gnou ame thi nitt gni ndieukka santhie Ethiopie mingui méngoo ak diamonoy paleolitique, guinaw jumtoukayi khér yign fa guiss ak yénéne mbiri art.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3388,"row":{"en":"This is a serious problem, as it can greatly influence public opinion and undermine democracy.","wo":"Loolu du lu baax ndax mën yàq bu baax xalaatu nit ñi, te nekkul luy dundal demokraasi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou dou lou bakh ndakh meun yakhe bou bakh khalaatou nitt gni té nekoul louy doundale démocrasi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3389,"row":{"en":"Granddaughter: I know, Grandma. You've told me that story a million times.","wo":"Sët bu jigéen bi: Xamnaa, Maam. Nettali ngama ko lu bari yoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSet bou djiguéne bi: khamna, Maam. Netali ngama ko lou bari yone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3390,"row":{"en":"The fluid forms a clear, watery swelling called edema.","wo":"Fluid bi dafay leer ba noppi ndoxe, ñu koy woowe ëdem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFluid bi dafay leer ba nopi ndokh, niou koy wowé eudem.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3391,"row":{"en":"Kings Cross is a serious rail hub and so is extremely simple to commute to.","wo":"Kings Cross tukkikaayu rail la bu yaatu la ba noppi yombal dem gi ak dikk gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKings cross toukikayou rail la bou yatou la ba nopi yombal dem gui ak dikk gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3392,"row":{"en":"The kittens eventually began to suffer from the neglect.","wo":"Muus yu ndaw yi tàmbali di dundu lu tiis ndax càgganteem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMouss you ndaw yi tambali di doundou lou tiss ndakh thiagantém.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3393,"row":{"en":"These groups use a variety of methods to recruit victims, including force, fraud, and deception.","wo":"Pexe yu bari la defkati ñaawtéef yooyu di jëfandikoo ngir am li ñuy wut, mën nañu la jàpp, nax la, wala gëmloo la lu amul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPexé you bari la déffkat yi niawtéff yoyou di dieufandiko nguir ame li gnouy woute, meun nagnou la diap, nakh la, wala gueumlo la lou amoul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3394,"row":{"en":"We're expecting a bumper crop of sugarcane, which is used to make rum.","wo":"Noo ngi waaja dagg ñàmbi suukër bi, ñu koy jëfandikoo ngir defar ci rhum.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNongi wadia dague gnambi soukeur bi, gnou koy dieufandiko nguir defar si rhum.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3395,"row":{"en":"The SMA says that it will continue to investigate the matter and that it will take further action if necessary.","wo":"SMA neena dina wéyal lànketam ci mbir mi, te dina jël matuwaay yi war suko jaree.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSMA néna dina wayal lankétam si mbir mi té dina dieul matouway yi war souko diarée.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3396,"row":{"en":"Rubber is used in a variety of places on a car, including the tires, brake pads, and seals.","wo":"Barina fu ñuy jëfandikoo kawsu ci biir oto, amna ci pëno yi, ci pedaali frein yi ak ci toogukaay yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina fou gnouy dieufandiko kawssou thi biir auto, amna thi peuno yi, thi pédale frein yi ak thi togoukay yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3397,"row":{"en":"Old Man: Yeah, I heard that too. They're saying that he's going to be doing random inspections of bars and restaurants to make sure that they're not selling liquor to minors.","wo":"Ku mag ki: Waaw, man itam dégg naa ko. Wax nañu ni dafay jekk saa rek dugg ci barabu jaayukaayu sàngara, ngir xool ndax nekku ñu di jaay sàngara xale yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou mag ki: waw mane itam deugg nako. wakh nagnou ni dafay diekk sa rek dougg thi barabou diayoukayou sangara, nguir khol ndakh nekkou gnou di diay sangara khalé yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3398,"row":{"en":"I knew that I must run, but my legs were leaden and I could not move.","wo":"Ma xamni dama wara daw, waaye sama tànk bañ, mënu ma yëngu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa khamni dama wara daw wayé sama tank bagn meunouma yeungou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":3399,"row":{"en":"What the hell are you doing, you idiot?!","wo":"Mbaam bu bon bi, looy def nii?!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbaam bou bone bi loy def nii ?!!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}